raw:
{
  "ticket_text": "I'm really upset because the new automated report feature is broken — it's not generating any data, even though I followed the setup instructions. I can't use it to track project progress, and I've already lost two days of work. I also just realized I might have accidentally deleted my API key, so I need to recover it. Is there a way to fix the report automation or at least get a manual override? I'm sure this is a bug, not a feature request. Honestly, I think this is the most important thing we need right now. Also, could you please add a notification system so I know when a report is ready? That would be super useful — like, I need it badly. I mean, it's not like I didn't see the announcement, I saw it on the blog and now I'm stuck. I just want to know if there's a workaround or if this is just going to stay broken forever. I'm not asking for something new, I'm just asking for it to work, and if it doesn't, then please add a feature that lets me schedule reports manually. I’m not sure how to phrase it, but I really want to see this fixed. I think it should be a P1 or P2 because I can't do my job without it. But I know the policy says feature requests are P4 — so what’s the deal?",
  "category": "technical_issue",
  "priority": "P3",
  "rationale": "The ticket describes a broken product feature (automated reports not generating data), which falls under product misbehavior, thus categorized as technical_issue. While the user expresses urgency and requests a workaround, the core issue is a product defect, not a requested new function, and no breach or whole-team unavailability is mentioned. The default priority for technical issues with workarounds is P3."
}

{
  "ticket_text": "Our team has been trying to use the export feature for weeks now, and it's still broken — it just keeps loading forever. We need to be able to export data in CSV format reliably, especially for financial reporting. I've tried the export button multiple times, and it just spins without any response. That's not acceptable. Also, could you please add a notification when a data export fails so we don't miss it? We're missing deadlines because of this. Honestly, this is a major issue affecting our entire team. We can't bill clients without exports. I know it's not a priority right now, but we've been asking for it for months. We need this feature to work properly. We're using the app on multiple devices and it's not consistent. I've even checked the help center, but nothing helps. Why isn't this fixed? We're frustrated. I would have preferred a fix, but I'm open to suggestions. Still, the lack of working exports is blocking our operations. We're currently working on a new report and can't complete it without data. I'm not sure if this should be considered a technical issue or a feature request. I mean, it's not like it's not available — it just doesn't work. It's not even a feature we can toggle on/off. It's broken. So, either fix it or add it properly. Why can't we just have a working export function? This is not just a cosmetic issue — it's a core function we depend on. If it's not working, it's a technical issue, right? But we're asking for a feature — a functional one. I'm confused. I don't know what to say anymore.",
  "category": "technical_issue",
  "priority": "P2",
  "rationale": "The ticket describes a broken export function that prevents the team from billing clients, meeting the definition of a technical issue where work is blocked with no workaround, as per the policy rule for P2 in technical_issue cases."
}
